<title>USA: GE capital unit to buy Unique Systems.</title>
<headline>GE capital unit to buy Unique Systems.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>GE Capital Services said on Thursday it agreed to acquire privately-held Unique Systems Corp of Calgary for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>Unique Systems provides information technology products.</p>
<p>GE Capital is a wholly owned subsidiary of General Electric Co.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
